{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b4643ec33b5748274b2d73b1abdebd12b0db6264ea3b66d41079f4ef9799f0e", "ja": "（今日はオフの伊織に誘われ、大型スーパーへ\n買い出しに来ている。……なぜスーパー？）", "zh": "（今天被休假的伊织邀请，来大型超市采购。……为什么是超市？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "35ecf3eee03d37af52a3d1f0d41d65706a1819464bc065e7cd6674874ae81dd4", "ja": "へぇ、ここがアンタのオススメのお店なの？\nま、確かに、品揃えは悪くなさそうね。", "zh": "哦，这里就是你推荐的店吗？\n嗯，商品种类确实挺丰富的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4d120a61bd6160bae08e312f160ffdba9e7324f7fe7a63bdb2cd3a6180c10d83", "ja": "この辺りでは一番大きい店だしな。……それより、\nせっかくのオフに、スーパーに何の用事があるんだ？", "zh": "这附近就数这家店最大了。……比起这个，\n难得休息一天，你来超市有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "406999ded5e261c2a9fe5576ae84ca25b54071c8d33ad2ac491243a40dfb1988", "ja": "私、今日はここでお菓子を買いたいのよ。\nどこに売ってるのか教えてくれる？", "zh": "我今天想在这里买点零食。\n你能告诉我在哪里卖吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0089316b4343fff06afbccac3f912ee9671d626106bd3f501797c2f672d9a2dc", "ja": "お菓子？　といっても、いわゆるジャンクな\nものしかないと思うけど……それでいいのか？", "zh": "零食？不过话虽这么说，我觉得这里应该只有所谓的垃圾食品……这样也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "f7068213bb6067f7d345f33265775b7f509bf165697b969073fd95fca1a7a4e0", "ja": "いいも何も。だってそういうお菓子が\n欲しくて、わざわざアンタに声かけたんだもの。", "zh": "好不好还用说吗。就是因为想吃那种零食，\n我才特地来找你的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "3f6a5d2e390462bdebe335e06a61e413851b032fbdb3804f17ec5d345e12f989", "ja": "ほら、この間ふたりで駄菓子屋さんに行ったでしょ？\nそれで……ちょっとそういうお菓子に興味が出たのよ。", "zh": "你看，前段时间我们俩不是一起去过零食铺吗？\n所以……我就对那种零食产生了点兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0e443b351d16be76ed2ed8edeb3e0a7fb7c22696eab935c669e39e826b09084a", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。確かに、あの時の伊織、\n山のように駄菓子を買ってたもんな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。确实，那时候的伊织买了一大堆粗点心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "16df1a3df1e1ceccb6c9919ab0fe1a0cb6a7ef66ffce2e823c675445d409da39", "ja": "なによ、大げさね！　お会計は5000円もいって\nなかったもの。山のようには言い過ぎよ！", "zh": "真是的，说得太夸张了！结账时明明连5000日元都没到，说什么堆成山也太过分了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f30a75d8f9996b88201c75ad43d149f240fbfc699e1817e36b3bbefc9e0b3612", "ja": "いや、駄菓子屋ではだいぶ高額だけどな……。\nまぁ、そんなに気に入ってくれたなら良かったよ。", "zh": "不，在怀旧零食店已经算是巨款了啊……\n不过，你那么喜欢的话就挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b999b8cca1cf67a7cf34181ffb245c14b65c1610d858b66b1fcd3b346631e8c3", "ja": "ただ、スーパーのお菓子売り場は、この前の駄菓子屋の\n比じゃない広さだからな。覚悟しておいた方がいいぞ？", "zh": "不过，超市的零食区可比上次那家杂货糖果店大得多。你最好做好心理准备哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "e668a2a1966f746047c2e4778b06a7fd484f1d80d4b433369097483ed787bf8a", "ja": "あら、それは楽しみね！\n常連客代表として、しっかりエスコート頼むわよ♪", "zh": "哎呀，那可真让人期待呢！\n你作为熟客代表，可要好好为我引路哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1012_null", "source_sha256": "b5eb768dcc646061421bd5ff4744d0a7973b95a19bb3f781452c781c2519d488", "ja": "買い物終了後……", "zh": "买完东西后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3ce7637f16bcbc7d7063dd43a76cb7955dc12fb7cccbc7d88a59a35436afc7e6", "ja": "お、重い……。\nこんなに買って、ちゃんと食べきれるのか？", "zh": "好、好重……。\n买了这么多，真的吃得完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "23d50a95bcf646149c2c7a288c2803e5d3614c976d83ca18e365506c5ccb2973", "ja": "なによ、情けないわね！\nそれに、そんな量一人で食べるわけないでしょ？", "zh": "什么嘛，真没出息！\n再说了，这么多东西，怎么可能让一个人吃完啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c827964881e3ff116236eebf5e658f7f072b3ec88b6b8e3255c6e37e6c054054", "ja": "まさか、俺の分か？\n気を遣わせて悪いな……でも嬉しいよ、伊織。", "zh": "难道是给我的？  \n让你费心了，真不好意思……不过我很高兴，伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "67efb710c26246c95a036a334b2892ae1805515d344a58d5ff8b9c1c824c05fd", "ja": "違うわよ！　図々しいわね……。\nこれは、劇場に持っていこうと思ってたの！", "zh": "才不是呢！你也太自作多情了吧……这是我本来打算带去剧场的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "7c9ce4509f2bca3ae14a05596a3381e7c664a7ad9edf2d51a9ca664f06ab8727", "ja": "一人ひとりに渡すのは難しいけど……\n控え室に置いておけば、たぶんみんな食べるでしょ？", "zh": "一个个分给大家虽然有点难……放在休息室里的话，大家应该都会吃吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1018_p", "source_sha256": "660ff92f9327591306d17572c61e5804cea49b489fda468a64b9728b57a09253", "ja": "なんだ、みんなへの差し入れだったんだな。\nそれなら、この量でも納得だ。", "zh": "原来是给大家的慰问品啊。\n这样的话，这个分量也就能理解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "102c50e9b76dd5674a9120f5e5180bcb99e7a4a4c0f81d8fd819472f0560335f", "ja": "そういうこと。まぁでも、安心していいわよ。\nアンタにもちゃーんと分けてあげるから♪", "zh": "就是这么回事。不过你可以放心。\n当然也会好好分给你一份♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1020_p", "source_sha256": "723a7b3728adb5d01b52a37ac1476a8a415a3119430a5ccd8f5c936186e9b476", "ja": "お、本当か？", "zh": "哦，真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "1dd1dae8685e5cd47f672eb10a9474e997e8dee6c65d158c63ed8dd8f3b96346", "ja": "ええ。これからこのお菓子ぜーんぶ味見しないとだから\n最後までちゃんと付き合いなさいよね？", "zh": "嗯。接下来我得把这些点心全部尝一遍，所以你可要陪我到最后，知道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1022_p", "source_sha256": "47e1bd95de97ce763b411be9a2469d00849f2ce597ca3b5005a807b2f1d21874", "ja": "全部……？\nチョコだけでも20種類は買ってなかったか……！？", "zh": "全部……？\n光巧克力就买了20种吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0334_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "cc57b3e62356f1cbc5ab11d394891f1c39e6062b36be16215b4e63c4e69f8f12", "ja": "だって、みんなに美味しくないものをあげるわけには\nいかないもの。当然でしょ？　にひひっ♪", "zh": "因为，总不能把不好吃的东西送给大家吧。那不是理所当然的吗？嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
